{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10260","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得离字 · 长孙铸","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得离字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大德讵可拟，高梧有长离。\n素怀经纶具，昭世犹安卑。\n落日去关外，悠悠隔山陂。\n我心如浮云，千里相追随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙铸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}